    "proximate_text": "The cause of the failure of ALHV0010 was determined to be a defect in the current to pressure (I/P) transducer. The defect was dislocation of the roll pin in the transducer nozzle assembly...With the roll pin dislocated, the ball could drop into the larger cavity below the control diameter. This would result in low and erratic output pressure.",
