  "chain": "roll pin dislocation in I/P transducer [cause TBD] -> ALHV0010 erratic/uncontrollable output pressure -> TDAFW discharge valve control lost -> TDAFW train inoperable beyond 72hr completion time -> (separate) FV-313 actuator failure -> TDAFW pump overspeed trip -> TS-required plant shutdown to Mode 4",
  "golden_questions": [
